# Encoding and line-ending rules for the launcher scripts.
#
# *.ps1 — start.bat runs these with powershell.exe (Windows PowerShell 5.1),
# which decodes a BOM-less script using the ANSI codepage (GBK on zh-CN
# Windows). A script holding Chinese messages then tokenizes into garbage and
# fails with "数组索引表达式缺失或无效" / "字符串缺少终止符". Keep the UTF-8 BOM
# in every .ps1 and keep the working tree LF.
*.ps1 text eol=lf

# *.bat — cmd.exe reads batch files with the codepage active at parse time and
# its label/goto handling is only reliable with CRLF endings.
*.bat text eol=crlf
